HEADER;
/*
  Component:  Flanged LM8UU linear bushing housing
  Standard:   LM-series boundary dimensions with a round flange; envelope only
  Family:     flanged linear bushing housing
  Size:       LM8UU
  Length:     26.7 mm
  Data source: Bore and body diameter from the LM-series size table; flange diameter and thickness default from the step.parts LM8UU flanged-round reference envelope.
  Notes:      Flanged round linear-bushing housing: one flange, a body, and a through bore. Mounting holes, seals, and rolling elements are omitted.
  Features modeled:      body, flange, bore
  Features omitted:      mounting-holes (flange hole patterns vary by manufacturer; none is asserted); rolling-elements (the housing envelope has no ball complement); seals (seals are not modelled)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Flanged LM8UU linear bushing housing'),'2;1');
